WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:02,780
Lao Pei

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,900
Can't tell

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
You still have a few moments to have a barbecue

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:19,140
what to do

5
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,270
Drinking is fine

6
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,340
Let’s finish talking about the business first.

7
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,340
A bottle of beer is nothing

8
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,340
Give me a sip first

9
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,340
You're too idle here

10
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,340
My old man's health is getting worse and worse

11
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,340
There has been a lot of fighting in the family over the past two years.

12
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,940
among brothers and sisters

13
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,940
I have the weakest foundation

14
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,360
I need you to help me

15
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,060
What's going on with your Pei family?

16
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,060
It's not suitable for me as an outsider to interfere.

17
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:42,060
My uncle may not agree either.
